msgstr "Moenie oorbetaling toelaat nie"

#: koha-tmpl/intranet-tmpl/prog/js/vue/components/SIP2/SIP2AccountResource.vue:276
msgid "Set if over-paying a patron's account via SIP2 should fail, rather than create a credit on the account"
msgstr "Stel in of oorbetaling van 'n gebruiker se rekening via SIP2 moet misluk eerder as om 'n krediet op die rekening te skep"

